# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reproducibility exceptions (see README "Reproducibility" section).
#
# The blanket *.parquet / *.csv / results/*.csv rules above are exactly why
# this repo previously had .gitkeep-only data/ dirs, no committed model, and
# no results/metrics.csv despite the README documenting them as expected
# outputs -- there was never a path for `make eval`'s outputs to be tracked.
# These explicit exceptions let the frozen sample data, trained model, and
# real measured metrics produced by scripts/run_real_pipeline.py be
# committed, while everything else generated locally (full-size re-fetches,
# scratch logs, etc.) stays ignored as before.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
!data/raw/sample_*.parquet
!data/processed/sample_*.parquet
!results/metrics.csv
!results/walk_forward_folds.csv
!results/run_manifest.json
